## Hard-first CREATE (not optional)

Before writing files, lock:

0. Remaining-work horizon (complete system, >= 40h expert, 4-10h agent)
1. First-attempt trap
2. Almost-correct algorithm
3. Hidden channel (generated/property, not a restatement)
4. Decoy plan (none only if `/app` is a tight single-module spec trap)
5. Visible weight target ~30%, hidden majority
6. Probes V/D/L/A expected outcomes

If any of 1-3 are blank, return to ENGINE_1. If remaining work is a
ticket (feature, repair, slice, stubbed module) return to ENGINE_1 even
when traps are named. Collection bar: `docs/odyssey-long-horizon.md`.

