## Difficulty mechanisms to implement (not a copied pipeline)

Do **not** stamp ingest -> staging -> export onto every slug. Implement the
mechanisms in a shape native to the collection family:

- Interaction: one-module patch fails later hidden groups
- Decoy off the hot path when several modules exist (probe D)
- Independent hidden trap (different root cause than visible)
- Almost-correct trap (probe A)
- Generated hidden group
- Hidden majority of `run_group` weight

